		AGMCORE_SpotAliasAry2 0 AGMCORE_SpotAliasAry putinterval
		AGMCORE_SpotAliasAry length
	}{0}ifelse
	AGMCORE_SpotAliasAry2 3 1 roll exch putinterval
	true set_spot_alias
